      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STAR OF PATRICK (6) was racing with great purpose before the latest appearance when he finished 5.5 metres away in third over 2050m at Port Pirie. It doesn't get any easier but he is good enough to take this out. IMA DESTROYER (2) finished third last start over 2230m at this track, beaten 12 metres. That was an improvement on the unplaced effort at this track the run before. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Tackles a similar assignment and she can find winning ways. QUARTARARO (7) is flying at present with two successive wins to his name, most recently at this track five days ago. Big chance to keep the ball rolling. SAMMY BARBARO (5) broke in the run but recovered to make it three top-three finishes on the trot last start when he finished 6 metres away in second over 2230m at this track. Can't make any mistakes against this field but he is right in the mix.",
